  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 403.04 Required Supporting Materials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 403.04 Required Supporting Materials. Individual applicants for renewal licensure shall provide, or arrange for the board to receive, the following documents supporting their applications:\n\n(a) Proof of continuing education supporting materials for each continuing education course taken within the licensing period.\n\n(b) A photograph of the applicant’s face, not less than 2 inches wide by 2 inches tall; and that accurately reflects the applicant’s current appearance within the last four licensing renewal periods.\n\n(c) Any additional documents pertaining to the requirements as listed in Saf-Mec 403.01 through 403.03.\n\nSource. #10848, eff 7-1-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-mec400.html"
